<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt;
mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none'><b><span style='font-size:11.0pt'>GEÇİCİ
MADDE 1- </span></b><span style='font-size:11.0pt'>(1) 1/1/2022</span><a
style='mso-footnote-id:ftn10' href="#_ftn10" name="_ftnref10" title=""><span
class=><i><span style='font-size:10.0pt;background:yellow;
